{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Battery Pack is a resource created in the ",["l","避雷针","Lightning Rod"]," during ",["l","天气","thunderstorms"]," or the ",["l","太阳能板","Solar Panel"]," after 7 sunny days."]],["p",["To acquire a Battery Pack from a Lightning Rod, during a thunderstorm a particular sound will be heard, which means that one of the rods is now charged, pulsating with energy. There is no guarantee that a specific lightning rod will be struck by lightning during a thunderstorm. On the day after the storm, a Battery Pack can be acquired from it."]],["p",["Battery Packs can sometimes be purchased from the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 1,500–2,500g and can be sold to Robin at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"],". Very rarely, a Battery Pack can be dropped by breaking boxes or crates in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". They may also be dropped by ",["l","蝙蝠","Iridium Bats"]," (5% chance). Three Battery Packs are the reward for completing the childrens Bundle. ",["l","肯特","Kent"]," and ",["l","潘姆","Pam"]," may also send the player a Battery Pack in the mail. They can also be acquired from a ",["l","黄貂鱼","Stingray"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," with a population of at least 9."]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Iridium_Sprinkler.png",48]],[["l","铱制洒水器","Iridium Sprinkler"]],["Waters the 24 adjacent tiles every morning."],[["i","(O)787","Battery Pack ×1"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"],["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," Level 9"]],[[["f","Crystalarium.png",48]],[["l","宝石复制机","Crystalarium"]],["Insert a gem of your choice and it will grow copies."],[["i","(O)787","Battery Pack ×1"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×99"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×5"],["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×2"]],[["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿#Mining Skill","Mining"]," Level 9"]],[[["f"